  "reason": "P0.5-02 delivery retains the six adopted appearance profiles, independent colors, settings-only controls, SAVE2/DB2 compatibility and same-tab settings draft/accepted-trace preservation from 1.0.5. A measured 9-15 second native AudioContext stall in Blockly 13.4.0 trashcan initialization is fixed for this silent editor: synchronous injection temporarily hides the audio feature and restores its exact descriptor in finally, without modifying dependencies or retaining a browser API replacement. The existing classic renderer CSS class and two-hash CSP remain. Real Rust generation/execution/judgement and learning identities are unchanged. The 45+3 real integration gates and complete frontend checks, including audio restoration invariants, were repeated after the final registered source edits.",
